# This harness bundles/screenshots against real design-system renders and
# reference parks. The fork this repo pushes to is PUBLIC, so none of the
# generated/binary/dependency output below may be committed — only the
# source tools (.mjs), package manifests, docs and samples/*.tsx are tracked.

node_modules/

# per-run output: bundled HTML/JS, probe.json, screenshots
out/
shots/

# cross-park corpus signatures (regenerated by probe.mjs)
signatures/

# screenshots / renders, wherever they land
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# playwright browser download cache, if ever created alongside the harness
.cache/
ms-playwright/

*.log
probe.json

# stray non-source artifacts: a sweep-result data dump and an unreferenced
# backup file (dead — nothing imports it), neither is source worth versioning
park-eval/noise-sweep-*.json
mp3d-render/prev-backup.tsx
